                                            ability to make assumptions regarding the continuation, signing, scope and timing of certain client, vendor
                                            and partner relationships and the commencement and timing of client projects, which reflect
                                            management&#8217;s current beliefs and expectations and may not materialize on the anticipated
                                            schedule or at all;</span></p></td></tr>
