</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact000860" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionTextBlock"><p id="xdx_800_eus-gaap--AssetAcquisitionTextBlock_z7HRikzo5qec" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
 <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>4.</b></span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span id="xdx_82E_zL6X2p299Ec2">ACQUISITIONS</span></b></span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Effective
May 15, 2026, the Company entered into an Asset Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;APA&#8221;) with EHCP, a New Jersey LLC, to acquire
certain assets. The acquisition has been accounted for as a business combination. Under the APA, the purchase price was $<span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedAssetsPurchasePrice_iI_pn6n6_c20260515__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--EmpowerHealthcareAndCompliancePartnersLLCMember_zD92Gp75uvzk" title="Purchase price"><ix:nonFraction name="CCLD:BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedAssetsPurchasePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-05-15_custom_EmpowerHealthcareAndCompliancePartnersLLCMember" id="Fact000862" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1</ix:nonFraction></span>
million, subject to deductions for the deferred revenue obligations assumed. The Company paid $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationPriceOfAcquisitionExpected_c20260515__20260515__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--EmpowerHealthcareAndCompliancePartnersLLCMember_zZdhYhkrh8r8" title="Consideration paid"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationPriceOfAcquisitionExpected" contextRef="From2026-05-152026-05-15_custom_EmpowerHealthcareAndCompliancePartnersLLCMember" id="Fact000864" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">681,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
upon closing and the remaining purchase price will be paid in installments, subject to certain provisions, and has been accounted
for as contingent consideration. Empower provides full-service healthcare compliance and advisory services. Empower helps medical
practices and health systems navigate the complex regulatory landscape through services spanning compliance and ethics, privacy and
security, revenue integrity, and merger and acquisition support. Empower also provides audit defense, risk mitigation, and
regulatory readiness, and operates an educational marketplace of training, webinars, and workshops for healthcare
professionals.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-012026-06-30_custom_EmpowerHealthcareAndCompliancePartnersLLCMember" escape="true" id="Fact000866" name="CCLD:ScheduleOfAllocationOfPurchasePriceTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_898_ecustom--ScheduleOfAllocationOfPurchasePriceTableTextBlock_hus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--EmpowerHealthcareAndCompliancePartnersLLCMember_z5rH38k0o8Zc" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
preliminary purchase price allocation of the Empower acquisition is summarized as follows:</span></p>

