<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
fair value of customer relationships was based on the estimated discounted cash flows generated by these intangibles. The goodwill from
this acquisition is deductible ratably for income tax purposes over fifteen years.</span></p>

