    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Healthcare
    claims clearinghouse which enables our clients to electronically scrub and submit claims and process payments from insurance companies.</span></td></tr>
