    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">MAP
    App is an industry-leading tool for benchmarking and measuring revenue cycle management performance, which was developed by the Healthcare
    Financial Management Association and is used by top hospitals and healthcare organizations nationwide.</span></td></tr>
